# A double-click on a folder's name renames the folder, as one on a space's name renames the space
# (asked on X, 27 Nov 2026). A click still opens or closes the folder at once, as in Arc; the
# double-click's first click has done that by the time the second arrives, so the second puts the
# folder back and opens the name field. On the folder's glyph every click opens or closes, however
# fast they come: 0.1.18 dropped a whole-row double-click rename because fast open/close clicks
# started renames. The clicks go through the event queue to the row, as the pointer's would.
budget rss=800 stalls50=20
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "showToolbar": false}
cra://debug?windowSize=1280x800
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=one
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
# A new folder opens its name field; Escape keeps "Folder". It starts open.
cra://action/newFolder
wait 1
cra://debug?key=%1B,53,0
wait 0.5
cra://debug?browserWindows=made
expect-log Cra browser windows made: .* openFolders=1/1
# The folder's row is 8,234, 312x40: its glyph centred at x 26, the name from about x 63.
cra://debug?snapshot=FolderRowView&out=/dev/null
expect-log snapshot: FolderRowView at 8,234 size 312x40

# On the glyph a double-click closes and opens the folder and renames nothing.
cra://debug?clickAt=26,254&clicks=2
wait 1
reject-log folder double-click: rename
cra://debug?browserWindows=glyph
expect-log Cra browser windows glyph: .* openFolders=1/1

# One click on the name closes it straight away.
cra://debug?clickAt=100,254
wait 1
cra://debug?browserWindows=click
expect-log Cra browser windows click: .* openFolders=0/1

# A double-click on the name opens the field and leaves the folder closed, as it was.
cra://debug?clickAt=100,254&clicks=2
expect-log folder double-click: rename, put back closed
wait 0.5
cra://debug?browserWindows=field
expect-log Cra browser windows field: .* openFolders=0/1
cra://debug?key=Q,12,0
cra://debug?key=x,7,0
cra://debug?key=%0D,36,0
wait 1
expect-log folder rename: new name, 2 characters
cra://debug?browserWindows=renamed
expect-log Cra browser windows renamed: .* openFolders=0/1
cra://debug?checkStore=1
